    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100776" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοικ-έσιον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνοίκησις</span>
			, esp. <i>marriage</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ίου συγγραφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PTeb.</u>
					809.5
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
